From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: michael moore <mrmoore27@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 01:33:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] prime: POST /nta/attest, the direct NTA path for payees
 that are not gateways

SOV-017. A TIDES payee with no gateway (a pay-with-work provider) files its
per-tip attestation straight to Prime's stats listener with the 0x4e fields as
JSON. It is checked against Prime's own node exactly as 0x4e is and filed in
the same book. Admission is for spam only: optional token (nta-attest-token-file,
0600), a global rate (nta-attest-rate), the script must be a live payee in the
window, and nta-attest-per-tip tries per script per tip. /nta.json gains a
direct section.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
